"Commendations are awarded by Artonans and appear on an Avowed's System profile."
"Chaos-fighting commendations exist in several kinds."
"Commendation embroidery has complex etiquette; wearing it beside meaningless text is dissonant."
"A planet's Contract keeps profiles of its commended Avowed and can share them with Artonans."
"Commendation patches are most properly hand-embroidered, by oneself or by a needlesinger."
